  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39465488",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "sourceHash": "666766331f1ce23d5a497625e48cbdebff18eb4b8c87c4dd2468af180f1a6d5c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 3,
          "en": "In this course section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3,
          "end": 6.99,
          "en": "we will explore how we can animate React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.99,
          "end": 9.21,
          "en": "how we can bring them to life",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.21,
          "end": 14.21,
          "en": "because whilst static apps that don't have any animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "of course also might work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 20.64,
          "en": "animated apps often look and feel better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.64,
          "end": 24,
          "en": "and therefore may also drive user engagement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 25.563,
          "en": "with your website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.43,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "Take this website here as an example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 33.09,
          "en": "and indeed this is the example we'll be working on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 34.713,
          "en": "throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.82,
          "end": 38.4,
          "en": "This website here has a starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.4,
          "end": 43.4,
          "en": "and then it has a challenges page where website users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.5,
          "end": 47.34,
          "en": "can create and manage challenges",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.34,
          "end": 51.84,
          "en": "and every challenge has a title, an image, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.84,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "And users can then also mark challenges as completed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.28,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "or failed and switch between different tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 63.243,
          "en": "to view those different challenges.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 69.23,
          "en": "Now, this website works fine and looks decent, I'd argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.51,
          "end": 72.87,
          "en": "but it can be improved by adding animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.87,
          "end": 76.32,
          "en": "For example, here's exactly the same page now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.32,
          "end": 80.283,
          "en": "enhanced with extra animations that have been added to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.36,
          "end": 83.64,
          "en": "And you'll see tiny little animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.64,
          "end": 87.15,
          "en": "in basically all areas of this website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.15,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "and therefore, I'd argue this website looks and feels nicer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 95.49000000000001,
          "en": "and website visitors might therefore be motivated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.49000000000001,
          "end": 97.97999999999999,
          "en": "to spend more time with your web app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.97999999999999,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "which ultimately of course is probably the goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 103.893,
          "en": "of every web app you're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 104.82,
          "end": 108.57,
          "en": "That's why in this course section we'll explore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 111.33,
          "en": "how you can animate React apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.33,
          "end": 116.33,
          "en": "and we'll actually start by taking a look at just CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.46000000000001,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "because you might not even know which features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 125.12,
          "en": "are built into CSS that can be used to animate parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.34,
          "end": 126.513,
          "en": "of your website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 127.74,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "But as you'll also see in this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 135.6,
          "en": "CSS animations might be enough in certain use cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 135.6,
          "end": 139.32,
          "en": "but they also have certain limitations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.32,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "And that's why for the majority of this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 148.05,
          "en": "we'll explore a third party package called Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 148.05,
          "end": 151.23,
          "en": "which is an amazing package for building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 151.23,
          "end": 155.07,
          "en": "and controlling more complex animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 155.07,
          "end": 157.92000000000002,
          "en": "And you will learn how to use that package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 157.92000000000002,
          "end": 162.92000000000002,
          "en": "how to for example, use it to animate elements on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 163.17000000000002,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "in and out to animate lists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 170.13,
          "en": "And also how to build scroll based animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 170.13,
          "end": 173.22,
          "en": "So animations that depend on the user scrolling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 173.22,
          "end": 176.61,
          "en": "on the website as you can see it on the starting page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 176.61,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "of that finished website, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 181.95,
          "en": "So plenty of things in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 181.95,
          "end": 183.243,
          "en": "Let's get started.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}